  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "生態工程與環境營造",
    "sub_ename": "ECOLOGICAL ENGINEERING AND ENVIRONMENTAL REHABILITATION",
    "describe_ch": "介紹生態工程之基本觀念，並分別針對河川、山坡地、城鄉、道路等運用領域，討論所面臨困境與其對應生態工程。其次考量氣候變遷下，城市環境經營管理之洪水和乾旱管理重要課題，透過水利與景觀生態的觀點，以集水區出流管制和河川環境營造技術手冊內容為工具，引導學生建立生態減災都市的環境營造思維。為使同學有機會將課程所學實際運用於現實環境，修課同學必需利用分組方式進行「專題式學習」，最後完成一份分組期末報告。",
    "describe_eh": "In this course, the basic concepts of ecological engineering is first introduced and followed by four fields of application, including, stream, slope land, urban, and road on their problems and responding ecological engineering methods. Flood and draught are worldwide challenges whilst city management. Therefore, this course will then introduce the concepts and procedures to develop an adaptive eco-city with flood disaster mitigation, watershed outflow control, and river environmental rehabilitation through the technical handbooks issued by WRA. To apply the concepts learned from the course to the real world, a group course project has to be finished and presented at the end of semester.",
    "pre_subname": "HY3033水文分析與模式應用、HY3037生態工程與環境營造",
    "pre_sub_id3": "HY3033",
    "pre_sub_ename": "HY3033 HYDROLOGIC ANALYSIS AND MODEL APPLICATION、HY3037 ECOLOGICAL ENGINEERING AND ENVIRONMENTAL REHABILITATION",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "能夠描述生態工程之定義、應用領域（河川、坡地、都市、道路）之議題及國際間之最新對應生態工法\t\t\t",
      "describe_en": "Students can describe the definition of ecological engineering, the issues of application fields, and their updated methods around the world."
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "認識水利署河川整治及環境營造手冊和相關法規",
      "describe_en": "\tStudents can understand the related river environmental rehabilitation legislations and technology manual by WRA"
    },
    {
      "seq": 3,
      "describe_ch": "建議具減洪之生態城市環境營造計畫\t",
      "describe_en": "Students can develop and establish an eco-city environment rehabilitation plan with flood disaster mitigation"
    },
    {
      "seq": 4,
      "describe_ch": "能夠在分組討論與作業中表現有效溝通及團隊合作的能力。\t",
      "describe_en": "Students can apply their abilities of effective communication and teamwork in group discussions and assignments."
    }
  ],
